# The `format-on-edit` hook (.claude/hooks/format-on-edit.js) runs
# `npx prettier --write` on every .md an agent touches. Two reasons that must not
# reach docs/:
#
# 1. ROADMAP.md is hand-formatted, with deeply nested italic continuation blocks
#    prettier reindents wholesale: a one-line status correction produced a
#    272-line whitespace diff, which collides with anyone editing it concurrently.
# 2. RULES.md is *generated* from config/kirichess.rules.json by
#    ui/scripts/gen-rules.mjs, and CI runs `npm run gen:rules:check` (roadmap 8.6).
#    Reformatting it after generation makes the generated output differ from the
#    committed file and fails the build.
docs/

